title: Cake_Quest
---
<<declare $dialogPhase = "">>
<<declare $visitedYet = false>>

<<dialogPhaseSetter NPC>>
<<if $dialogPhase == "start">>
    <<jump cake_Start>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_taken">>
    <<jump cake_quest_taken_return>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_complete">>
    <<jump cake_quest_complete>>
<<elseif $dialogPhase == "quest_complete_return">>
    <<jump cake_quest_complete_return>>
<<else>>
    <color=red>RED</color>: I don't know what to do. This is a debug message.
<<endif>>
===

title: cake_Start
---
<<set $visitedYet to true>>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
<color=red>RED</color>: Hey roomie!
<color=red>RED</color>: How were classes today?
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->They were great!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        <color=red>RED</color>: Great! Glad to hear.
        <color=red>RED</color>: Mine sucked.
    ->They were just okay.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        <color=red>RED</color>: Just okay is better than bad!
        <color=red>RED</color>: Mine sucked.
    ->I hate this school.
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        <color=red>RED</color>: Oh!
        <color=red>RED</color>: Well, happy you're here.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
<color=red>RED</color>: Oh! By the way...
<color=red>RED</color>: It's Josh's birthday today.
<color=red>RED</color>: You remember Josh?
<color=red>RED</color>: Our other roomate who lives with us?
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Oh yeah, I remember Josh, the third person who lives in this suite.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
<color=red>RED</color>: Exactly!
<color=red>RED</color>: Well, I'm planning a <i> surprise birthday party </i> for him!
<color=red>RED</color>: I'm working on decorations, I just need <i> your </i> help with the cake!
<color=red>RED</color>: I dont have any of the ingredients.
<color=red>RED</color>: You should be able to find them scattered around the hallway.
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Scattered in the halls? Cake ingredients??
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        <color=red>RED</color>: Yeah! You'll see them laying around.
    ->Sounds great!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        <color=red>RED</color>: Great! I knew I could count on you!
<color=red>RED</color>: Good luck roomie! Be quick!
<<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "quest_taken">>
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
<<hide_cursor NPC>>

===

title: cake_quest_taken_return
---
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
<color=red>RED</color>: Hey roomie! How's the cake search going?
<<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "pc">>
    ->Great!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
        <color=red>RED</color>: Awesome! Back to it! Josh will be home soon.
        <color=red>RED</color>: Once we have all the ingredients, we'll just mix them up and pop it in the oven.
        <color=red>RED</color>: 15 minutes at 800 degrees should do the trick!
        <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
   
===

title: cake_quest_complete
---
<<if $visitedYet == false>>
    <<set $visitedYet to true>>
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "npc">>
    <color=red>RED</color>: Oh! Hey roomie!
    <color=red>RED</color>: How did you know I needed these?
    <color=red>RED</color>: Did someone tell you about the suprise party? For our third roomate Josh?
    <color=red>RED</color>: It's almost like you knew somehow to get them for me.
    <color=red>RED</color>: Like, maybe you've already done this, and now you're doing it again.
    <color=red>RED</color>: You were supposed to talk to me, learn about my quest, accept my quest, go on the quest, return from the quest, and then give me the items.
    <color=red>RED</color>: Just like how every other game works.
    <color=red>RED</color>: Was this experience not good enough for you?
    <color=red>RED</color>: Anyway, suuuupes excited for the party!
    <<dialogPhaseGetter NPC "quest_complete_return">>
    <<cam_move NPC_Cam_Rig "return">>
<<else>>
    <color=red>RED</color>: Awesome! You got the ingredients!
    <color=red>RED</color>: Just in time, too.
    <color=red>RED</color>: I'll get started on this right away! This should be the best party ever.
    <color=red>RED</color>: Thanks so much for your help!
<<endif>>

===

title: cake_quest_complete_return
---
<color=red>RED</color>: Uhhhh...
<color=red>RED</color>: I think we're all done here.
<color=red>RED</color>: You're acting.....
<color=red>RED</color>: .......
<color=red>RED</color>: ...sus..
===